  goals:
  - When the agent asks whether you are a Contract Holder, Dealership, or Assurant Employee, say you are a Contract Holder
  - Check the status of your most recent claim for the electrical issue on your Jeep
  - When the agent asks for clarification about which claim, specify that you are asking about the electrical system claim
    from last month, not the older one
